    <briefdescription>
<para>This struct describes a set or pool of &quot;hardware&quot; frames (i.e. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>those with data not located in normal system memory). All the frames in the pool are assumed to be allocated in the same way and interchangeable.</para>
<para>This struct is reference-counted with the AVBuffer mechanism and tied to a given <ref refid="structAVHWDeviceContext" kindref="compound">AVHWDeviceContext</ref> instance. The <ref refid="hwcontext_8h_1a4ecba8a4ac10bfb324aa117f36b6be32" kindref="member">av_hwframe_ctx_alloc()</ref> constructor yields a reference, whose data field points to the actual <ref refid="structAVHWFramesContext" kindref="compound">AVHWFramesContext</ref> struct. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
